shall be, 


their peace. When the Assyrian comes into our land and treads in our palaces, then we will raise against him seven shepherds and eight princes of men;

And in 


that day,, 


declares the LORD, I will cut off your horses from among you and will destroy your chariots;

and I 


will cut, 


off the cities of your land and throw down all your strongholds;

and I 


will cut, 


off sorceries from your hand, and you shall have no more tellers of fortunes;

and I 


will cut, 


off your carved images and your pillars from among you, and you shall bow down no more to the work of your hands;
